              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naalosenenoto ikerubin, kolosenenete akokoron kosiepionokee: nakitonyoununoto ikerubin abebenokakec adokar anyoun kokwap, akokoron da mam ebelonokinos anyoun kosiepionokec, ",
          "type": "text",
