              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kitonyout ikerubin abebenokakec, kodokasi anyoun kokwap, ketei eoŋ kwape alomuniata, akokoron da kosiepionokee: kobwaata kokirigi loka erute lokokide loka etogo loka EJAKAIT; kojai da aibuses naka Edeke loka Isirael kokujukec.",
